---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<Layout 
  title="Legal Notice, Privacy & Cookies | Cesar Santos" 
  description="Legal information, privacy policy, and cookie policy for Cesar Santos · Physiotherapy & Health." 
  lang={lang} 
  canonicalPath="/en/aviso-legal"
>
  <article class="article-detail" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px;">
    <span class="hero-subtitle">Compliance (GDPR & Legal Notice)</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
      Legal Notice, Privacy Policy & Cookie Policy
    </h1>

    <div style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-color); font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <section style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--color-secondary);">
          1. Owner Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          In compliance with European and Spanish electronic information laws, the following details identify the owner of this website:
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
          <li><strong>Owner:</strong> Cesar Santos</li>
          <li><strong>Qualification:</strong> Registered Physiotherapist (Degree from ONCE University School of Physiotherapy · UAM)</li>
          <li><strong>Specialty:</strong> Musculoskeletal Manual Therapy, Therapeutic Exercise & Clinical Psychoneuroimmunology (PNI)</li>
          <li><strong>Contact:</strong> Via the official contact form on this website.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--color-secondary);">
          2. Privacy Policy (GDPR)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Under Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR), we inform you that any personal data submitted via the contact form is processed solely to answer user inquiries. You retain full rights to access, rectify, or request deletion of your data at any time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--color-secondary);">
          3. Cookie Policy
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use strictly necessary technical cookies to remember your preferences (such as dark mode and language choice). Analytical cookies are loaded only if you explicitly accept them via the consent banner.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--color-secondary);">
          4. Scientific Dissemination, Authorship & Disclaimer
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          The articles published on this website are for <strong>educational and dissemination purposes</strong>. Cesar Santos acts as a science communicator, synthesizing and reviewing published medical evidence into accessible summaries.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          Bibliographic references, DOI identifiers, and PubMed links credit the <strong>original studies and primary researchers</strong>, who hold full ownership of their respective research findings.
        </p>
        <div style="background-color: rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.05); border-left: 4px solid #dc3545; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 15px;">
          <strong>Health Disclaimer:</strong> The content on this website (educational articles, guides, and activity calculators) is strictly informative. It does not replace individualized medical or physiotherapeutic diagnosis, evaluation, or treatment by a qualified health professional.
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
